    {
      "id": "claim_26b703167494443096772554d21d3b33",
      "statement": "claudebar integrates with Claude Code by patching the single `statusLine` key of the user-owned `settings.json` (a foreign file, not claudebar's own TOML) so it points at a fixed `claudebar render` command, leaving every other key untouched.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/setup.rs#L1-L8",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:d1e46c941a240c064c870f2242b3205d76de0d5b3fd8203439f28e4ddadf627d:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/setup.rs#L189-L194",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:0d3c27fcf293d2567c57c91499ad5a7a01cb51f52bd413f058a34761319dd558:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_c28d0f6df69e4c6e8346d10eedf37ff1",
      "statement": "The command wired into `statusLine` is the fixed constant `STATUSLINE_COMMAND = \"claudebar render\"`, serialized as `{\"type\":\"command\",\"command\":\"claudebar render\"}`; it is never built by formatting external input into the JSON command field.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/setup.rs#L119-L134",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:9c3c06db5a44dff7bf8b9963a4fe0ba90c16a79fe11237d7e0e3637cc01deb95:"
