      "id": "claim_d671fabbe4814458b8ab37b42de83f2b",
      "statement": "setup.rs unit tests cover desired_status_line binary-path override, all classify force/state combinations, malformed JSON and non-object roots surfacing as Parse errors, missing-file-as-empty-object, save/load roundtrips, apply preserving unrelated keys, backup path construction/copy, config-path precedence, and editor precedence.",
