          "resource": "repo://src/render/mod.rs#L1-L4",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:dc566641947085dbcb137419c0cc01de78918f575fe88b90fed485f8b517471b:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_578a871673654f86ad8a3b2a9d4cbeb8",
      "statement": "`resolve_config` resolves the config path from `--config` then `Config::default_path` (`$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/claudebar/config.toml`, falling back to `$HOME/.config/claudebar/config.toml`) and applies theme/style/segment overrides, warning on stderr — never failing — when a present config is unparseable (falling back to defaults), when a theme or style name is unknown, or when a segment name is unknown (dropping it from the list), so a corrupted config degrades to defaults rather than failing the status line.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main.rs#L49-L93",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:7b8a8b7751ebd64b9cbb64b3c8ef64d36c1193e1e52a01e3a4d72b2da6ad2f0d:"
